- Exchange of discovery and document production (often with set deadlines).
- Mediation or settlement conferences (often required before trial).
- Parenting evaluation or custody investigation (if ordered).
- Motions for temporary orders (if either side requests).
- Pretrial motions and scheduling of trial dates (if no settlement).
- Final hearing/trial and entry of final orders.

