2. Discuss whether to seek temporary orders now.
3. Review what documents I must provide in the next 2 weeks.
4. Proposed schedule for discovery/mediation/trial (ask him to prepare a proposed scheduling order).
5. Discuss likely custody evaluation and potential costs.
6. Confirm communication method and billing/retainer status.

