  - How does this court define legal vs. physical custody? What factors affect “best interests of the child” here?
  - What parenting-time schedules are typical? How should I propose a schedule?
  - If relocation is an issue, how is that handled?
- Child support and finances
  - How is child support calculated here (guidelines/formula)?
  - What documentation will the court require (pay stubs, tax returns, benefits)?
  - How do we handle health insurance and uncovered medical expenses?
