- If the other parent wants to relocate, what is the legal standard and how do we respond?
- How do modifications and enforcement work later (if circumstances change or the other parent violates orders)?
- What are your fees, billing practices, and expected retainer for the next phase? What additional costs should I expect (mediator, evaluator, experts)?

Documents and evidence to gather and bring to your attorney
- Court papers you already have (petitions, temporary orders, prior filings, service documents)
- Any communications between parents (texts, emails, social media DMs) that are relevant to parenting/time or finances
