Settlement strategy & communication
- What is your negotiation strategy? What are reasonable short-term and long-term goals?  
- Should we attempt direct negotiation with opposing counsel, or handle everything through filings?  
- Any recommendations for communication with the other parent (what to document, what to avoid)?

Contingencies & post-judgment issues
- How easy/hard is it to modify custody/support later if circumstances change?  
- How is enforcement handled if the other parent violates orders?  
- What should I do if the other parent refuses to comply with temporary orders?

Document checklist to collect and bring to your attorney/status conference
- Photo ID, kids’ birth certificates, current custody orders (if any).  
