  - Birth certificates, school records, attendance, special education plans, medical records, immunization records
  - Documentation of extracurricular costs, daycare receipts, parenting schedule history
- Communication and evidence
  - Texts, emails, social media messages relevant to custody/support; save as PDFs/screenshots with timestamps
  - Photos, voicemails, recordings (check legality in your jurisdiction)
- Safety or abuse documentation (if relevant)
  - Police reports, medical reports, emergency shelter or protective order documents
- Witnesses and statements
