- Draft a concise email to Robert Kim with the prioritized questions and request for a meeting before the status conference?  
- Build a document checklist you can print and use?  
- Search your inbox for Robert Kim’s emails and prepare a draft reply or meeting request?

Also please confirm which court (Denver or Hennepin County) and whether there are any urgent safety issues.

